    <string name="changelog_v112_title">v1.1.2</string>
    <string name="changelog_v112_body" formatted="false">• Scoped custom colors to non-media cards only; media cards (and non-media cards with Follow Media enabled while media is active) yield to album art without tint clashes\n• Added an independent Custom Gradient Mask Color picker alongside Custom Card Color, with ARGB opacity sliders for both\n• Automatically opens release notes on first launch after updating to a new version</string>
    <string name="changelog_v111_title">v1.1.1</string>
    <string name="changelog_v111_body" formatted="false">• Fixed bottom-left and bottom-right highlight corners misaligning when bottom glow is enabled and non-media mask opacity is 0\n• Aligned lockscreen/shade mask gradients and bottom highlights with native G2 smooth corners and horizontal swipe offset\n• Added new ColorOS 17 UI with an option to switch back to Classic UI\n• Refactored Appearance settings into secondary subpages with a collapsible inline color picker</string>
    <string name="changelog_v110_title">v1.1.0</string>
    <string name="changelog_v110_body" formatted="false">• Fixed lockscreen media card mask snapping out when expanding into Music Lockscreen; now fades smoothly with expansion progress\n• Split Music Lockscreen backdrop opacity into an independent control (0% – 100%)\n• Replaced piecewise mask stops with a C2-smooth gradient + dithering and added linked Start/End/Midpoint bounds\n• Scoped non-media &amp; notification follow-media tinting strictly to surfaces with an active media Fluid Cloud\n• Eliminated v1.0.9 lag &amp; frame drops via draw caches, probe throttling, and coalesced config reloads</string>
    <string name="changelog_v109_title">v1.0.9</string>
    <string name="changelog_v109_body" formatted="false">• Split non-media mask opacity into independent Follow-Media ON and OFF sliders (0% – 200%)\n• Unified mask concentration naming to Opacity\n• Added shared Gradient Mask Template controls across all masks (Start, End, Midpoint, Strength)</string>
    <string name="changelog_v108_title">v1.0.8</string>
    <string name="changelog_v108_body" formatted="false">• Upgraded to ColorOS 17 UI &amp; motion: collapsing large header, top gradient blur, and overscroll bounce\n• Redesigned menus and dialogs into floating bottom sheets, centered cards, and anchored popups\n• Fixed remote update changelog line breaks, Markdown headings, and Unicode formatting</string>
    <string name="changelog_v107_title">v1.0.7</string>
    <string name="changelog_v107_body" formatted="false">• Fixed non-media cards and lockscreen notification rim highlights not reverting to default colors after closing media\n• Added in-app update checker sourcing from LSPosed Repository</string>
    <string name="changelog_v106_title">v1.0.6</string>
    <string name="changelog_v106_body" formatted="false">• Fixed mask follow-media tinting failing when system Flowing Contour (Highlight) is turned off\n• Added "Follow System" language option (auto-selects Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, or English)\n• Simplified UI labels and descriptions across the app</string>
    <string name="changelog_v105_title">v1.0.5</string>
    <string name="changelog_v105_body" formatted="false">• Split highlight brightness &amp; chroma (0%–200%) for Large Media Cards vs Single-Line cards\n• Added "Notification Rim Follows Media" toggle\n• Fixed stacked lockscreen cards losing tint or flickering on expand\n• Fixed lockscreen non-media tint staying on the previous song and lock-to-shade transition issues\n• Fixed white pickup-code card backgrounds being too bright for white text\n• Added Fluid Cloud Test Mode &amp; test notification sender</string>
    <string name="changelog_v104_title">v1.0.4</string>
    <string name="changelog_v104_body" formatted="false">• Matched brightness between lockscreen media cards and expanded cards at equal opacity\n• Separated mask opacity from card background opacity\n• Added Media Mask Opacity, Non-Media Mask Opacity sliders &amp; Non-Media Follow Media toggle\n• Kept clean translucent glass in fullscreen AOD and added Translucent AOD Notifications toggle\n• Smoother lockscreen-to-AOD fade for media cards and highlights\n• Grouped sub-menu controls into cards and added Changelog in About</string>
    <string name="changelog_v103_title">v1.0.3</string>
    <string name="changelog_v103_body" formatted="false">• Organized appearance settings into four collapsible menus\n• Added brightness &amp; chroma sliders for media-tinted masks\n• Linked lockscreen opacity to lockscreen dark masks</string>
    <string name="changelog_v102_title">v1.0.2</string>
    <string name="changelog_v102_body" formatted="false">• Split black mask toggles for Expanded Card, Lockscreen, and Shade\n• Added mask tinting from album cover art</string>
    <string name="changelog_v101_title">v1.0.1</string>
    <string name="changelog_v101_body" formatted="false">• Split highlight into brightness &amp; chroma sliders (0%–200%)\n• Improved highlight color blending</string>
    <string name="changelog_v100_title">v1.0.0</string>
    <string name="changelog_v100_body">• Initial API 102 release with FP capsule alignment, overlap hide, music lockscreen FP, and Fluid Cloud tuning</string>
